Career</a></li> <li>nella <a href=\"https://newsletter.usi.ch/ns_published/it/1\">newsletter USI Flash</a></li> </ul> <p><strong>Vedi le <a href=\"/it/originalnode/663\">Career Stories</a> già pubblicate</strong></p> <p>Oltre a scrivere la tua career story puoi anche portare la tua storia di carriera live nell'ambito del programma <strong><a href=\"/it/originalnode/8977\">Visiting Alumni</a>:</strong></p> <ul> <li>in <a href=\"/it/originalnode/15434\">aula</a></li> <li>al <a href=\"/it/originalnode/14281\">Master Info Day</a></li> </ul> <p>Se vuoi partecipare anche tu, contattaci: <a href=\"mailto:alumni@usi.ch\">alumni@usi.ch</a></p>"}],"ctas":[],"nav":[{"label":"Area alumni","href":"/it/universita/info/alumni"},{"label":"Il mio profilo Alumni","href":"/it/universita/info/alumni/my-alumni/profilo"},{"label":"La mia Career Story","href":"/it/universita/info/alumni/my-alumni/la-mia-career-story"},{"label":"Benefici","href":"/it/universita/info/alumni/my-alumni/benefici"},{"label":"Il mio Chapter","href":"/it/originalnode/8951"},{"label":"Calendario Alumni","href":"/it/universita/info/alumni/eventi/calendario-alumni"},{"label":"Alumni Talks","href":"/it/universita/info/alumni/meet-the-alumni/digital-talks"},{"label":"Visiting Alumni","href":"/it/universita/info/alumni/meet-the-alumni/visiting-alumni"},{"label":"Chapter Meetings","href":"/it/universita/info/alumni/meet-the-alumni/chapter-meetings"},{"label":"Reunions","href":"/it/universita/info/alumni/meet-the-alumni/reunions"},{"label":"Dati e cifre","href":"/it/universita/info/alumni/ritratti/i-laureati-usi"},{"label":"USI Career Stories","href":"/it/universita/info/alumni/ritratti/career-stories"},{"label":"USI Alumni Mentors","href":"/it/universita/info/alumni/ritratti/usi-alumni-mentors"},{"label":"Indagine Placement","href":"/it/universita/info/alumni/ritratti/indagine-laureati"},{"label":"Chapters","href":"/it/universita/info/alumni/network/chapters"},{"label":"Executive Alumni","href":"/it/universita/info/alum